      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b4a5468eb7974992fd22f9c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要有人对东商变革下指示，\n她便会觉得自己没有受到信任。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a17bdfb0f87fbce80ce246f4e108f95a7b642533a352f26443818d4838dd00b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:038ef70dabd0e035131c9e5d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34763998c364b1830332adab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "祖母如此说道，并指点训练员，\n他该抱持的心态并不是给予引导，\n而是给予支持……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1144b15f3892193fd8d9626e9d32638039b0655d1d5df4724c101fab6ffbc278",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7674e39d9e76bc4fe6db3bc4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "魔法之家",
      "source_fingerprint": "9afe2d2e5dfebfb3d85c3d1b3f34ae97e975794282c08f4914439cf0aef095ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
