    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49b00457f3d535f7996ca92a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东商变革来进行训练却闹起脾气说没有心情跑步。\n但她其实有偷偷观察训练员的反应。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff18c75c10150c8d4cd77205ec652b52f110493d4e2dd38b3b263b94f2e61bcd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c69496c74eebb9cb78a69369",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceded6a004ab664b8820f830",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员认为如果她真的没有干劲，\n应该不会来这里。\n因此相信她有自己的理由，选择默默等待她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df1dfb96e6dc52e1902747499f396e3eb846634a62f95e25b0e1e7fb4ac9b117",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cc0e2035d8c0033c26ca08a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe299ad9528bec0452030734",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这时东商变革说出自己的真心话，\n“你肯相信我，听我的意见。\n也不会说这样才对，要我压抑自己”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a02010e73b737682fd32694909de0f5cb58245bedd19a54410a9055952d245cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e9e53e7e8a6f5ccff019290",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42928469be8578754cc16206",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她认同了训练员，说出自己想参加的比赛。\n而目标是“樱花赏”。\n就这样，两人再次踏上寻找赛跑魔法的旅程。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5203c05fcb1a0ced55a5d3c9d40830151e4a1261636d8007c448d79bca4b98a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19e678be461bba450f93ebb5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一闪一闪・亮晶晶☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "04ddcb62e941c02f35b2b71eb1575d446db3015122e97a8e2d0d918a1715fbca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dbe1ccb95ddbf7ed6420310",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东商变革来到了美术馆。\n她的目的是看展示中的\n后冠路线赛马娘的照片，从中学习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "247abc0166a888a21468f4091ccf971ce365ef50df7dec3c0462de86558afbe5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff023b531770f29d7ed7ccf8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过她在那里听见有观众说，\n经典三冠路线的赛马娘实力比三后冠路线的强，\n因此气愤不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0594a3496eec44a39e899b0ef20e011bd20f69b0dce6f76ca979d867a597a5a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d6fc99e9ee67210a91b2d66",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "明明强大的赛马娘是强在实力，\n和选择哪条路线无关，世人却不这么认为，\n这让她难以忍受。",
      "source_fingerprint": "372d9051062ac3d6cb1eeaaf35f4eedf131ca2f4b6b0996daa713337b8b60b6e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5f289c3501d6a48a20312a0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她想破坏这个成见，让大家清醒。\n因此她下定决心，无论如何都要找到赛跑魔法，\n“改变这个世界”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1983ea3a361b26eb8d5f70260f249f2338fb9781bd0142790a6081ed4d9a39c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1c1cf491ab04e6277f4422b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "太无聊了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3fd58946005af286eb5552ca8bd08fe746aef2a8fcb86336778fb8843b91ac3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73443f45eab20267e4b85247",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a861ab981dcca962f04d2e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东商变革宣布将在“宝冢纪念”\n对全世界施展赛跑魔法。\n荒漠英雄在得知这件事后下定决心──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ca7c2ccb6bcfa8b67e9b54032b4d97230495b95cb5a429b03c52ec7716b7ea7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a38edc8222ad41199ce56b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed82a3478f824fef5505653b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她表示自己将达成秋古马三冠，\n成为年度代表赛马娘与三冠路线赛马娘的代表，\n在“宝冢纪念”击败魔女。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b625439e30f1dee007aeb60198c74f298785011bd599a542f2720bfeaf720f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d5c6a603d00c052018a93a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db6903a8b60f65d1842f95e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "实现赛跑魔法所需满足的最后一个条件──\n“特别的劲敌”就此达成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84c3e2ed866d29f922504d8313637bba590420277f366d23a918f4430d9d0ce4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044404.json",
      "json_path": [
