      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38e5506490e5297a427b28dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "魔女与英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb6b3f019ee9593549e3fe7791976baee5a0568e6d5b14522ba83bd16a9fb3c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6da2c7b18ae0fb7f1aa37b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东商变革成功施展出最强的赛跑魔法后，\n便觉得不需要再参赛，\n而开始学习其他魔法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7ce738080d157452b26c78f05f3b7b129a247a5bc524834629f988afd53c55c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f5391a08340a74f6244db9e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时，她听说曾和自己一起\n竞争三后冠的赛马娘伤势痊愈，\n但在和川上公主并跑练习后，决定远离比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9fbd54c7a29dd9d2fcbc320f1a44c27e90f6cffe966b20b45165e99d57a4d6d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e19b3f49e1f4fbc0295b4d8a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而询问当事人才知道，她其实是因为看了\n宝冢纪念，而对自己和其他选手的差距感到绝望。\n她说，“不管是谁，只要因伤休养便会落后”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2852a9558a23cc4c70f7294b322867ad7f66e77da565f4c2169cbab3366d833e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b109e37f8aaaf93e81157018",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看见同期的对手被这种常识局限，\n东商变革气势汹汹地表示要对她施展魔法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d985f114bd7dec3784142c4b3a3b3cc08b5867e3143f2f202dc4d3ef87381c1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c345c38f1aa312e18652e87",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在决定下一个目标是“天皇赏（秋）”后，\n东商变革拜托自己的特别劲敌荒漠英雄一起参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "381e5bc47c80e637b2286e29ef7e88f4a69761021da41a373d0d19989083e104",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d56c6778474086ed6b51039",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "结局？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7862debce5af77873df3440d20cc8f085d1aebecf1a5f50cfeab4f2dd7335a46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
