      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然荒漠英雄表示东商变革的魔法\n不仅除去了她的消极，还带给她勇气，\n不过……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0e32462312cc258e38d3fc4d6ae703a847e64c9fc3b3e3c30ddce1e2646306f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
