      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是不甘心的感觉却一直没有消失。\n……难道她其实也希望\n东商变革能对自己施展魔法吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "af5c75780bb66d418ab3eaf14675d5163abe11b3d5d255ea0c56bdcc0ecc6062",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
